# board/xilinx/zynq/zynq-adrv9009/board.c set_dfu_alt_info(). Compiled in rather
# than an env default because (a) the env lives on the ESP FAT (ENV_IS_IN_FAT)
# and may be absent exactly when DFU recovery is wanted, and (b) zynq-common.h's
# bootcmd_usb_dfu*/usb_thor* overwrite dfu_alt_info during a bootstd scan, which
